# Thesis repository: agent rules

**Before any thesis, plan, benchmark, or artefact edit: read `AGENT.md` in the repo root.**

## Document roles (do not confuse these)

| Document | Status |
| --- | --- |
| `Thesis_Plan_v2.tex` / `.pdf` | **Supervisor-facing, reviewed** |
| `Thesis_v2.tex` / `.pdf` | **Supervisor-facing, reviewed** (Chapter 1 is the draft introduction; chapters 2--8 are five prose paragraphs each, matching the draft's chapter list since 26 Aug 2026) |
